Subject: [PATCH 12/15] Prepare the 0.3.0 release

Bump the version to 0.3.0, give the crate and source distribution an
explicit file list, and rewrite the architecture guide for the 0.3.0
code with a measured performance section. Record the release-candidate
checks: Rust checks, CLI request, capabilities, native sweep,
independent validation, installed wheel, tutorial and manual blocks,
campaign replay, SciPy search and the installed Python optimization
timings; keep the 0.2.0 copies under evidence/release-0.2.0. Seed the
CMA-ES example's sampler so its output is reproducible.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
